@page "/"
@attribute [Authorize]
@rendermode InteractiveServer
@using NiftySignal.Dashboard.Components.Dashboard

<PageTitle>NiftySignal Dashboard</PageTitle>

@* Dashboard reorg (2026-09-21, docs/LIVE_PARITY_PLAN.md): the live-strategy pipeline
   (OptionsScoreThreeWaySwitchMaxPainConfirmed, via LiveOptionsScorePanel) is now the PRIMARY
   content on this page -- promoted to the top, above the older feed/connection panels. The old
   CoreScore Hysteresis/Crossover strategies were retired from live trading the same day (see
   MarketDataIngestionWorker's own cutover comment); ScorePanel now labels itself retired and
   sits at the bottom of the grid rather than being removed outright, since its Core Score/
   Strategy Positions readout is still useful as a "last known state" reference.

   Futures-crossover live-wiring task (2026-09-21, same doc's "Futures crossover: wired live"
   section): LiveFuturesCrossoverPanel added alongside (not replacing) LiveOptionsScorePanel --
   both volume-bar-pipeline strategies are live and independently paper-trading (see
   LivePaperTradeRow.Strategy's own doc comment), so both need to be visible at once, clearly
   labeled which is which. Registered in Program.cs but NOT wired into deploy.ps1/the VM as part
   of this task -- local-only until a separate, explicit deploy step. *@
<div class="dashboard-shell">
    <StatusBar />

    <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); gap:16px; padding: 20px 20px 0;">
        <LiveOptionsScorePanel ShowFullPageLink="true" />
        <LiveFuturesCrossoverPanel />
    </div>

    <div class="dashboard-grid">
        <FlatTradeLoginPanel />
        <LiveQuotePanel />
        <OiProfilePanel />
        <PositionsPanel />
        <OptionChainPanel />
        <PerformancePanel />
        <ScorePanel />
    </div>
</div>
